{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2022-03-03 08:10:00', 'title': 'FISERV BOARD ELECTS CEO FRANK BISIGNANO AS CHAIRMAN AND DOYLE SIMONS AS LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR', 'text': 'BROOKFIELD, WIS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE FISERV BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTED FRANK BISIGNANO, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND A DIRECTOR OF FISERV, AS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD.'}